From: "Anthony Fu (via agent)" <reg-github-bot@antfu.me>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 09:39:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(app): stop prompting for a worktree setup script

The sidebar showed a "no setup script" callout with an "Open project
settings" action for every git project whose paseo.json has no
worktree.setup. Projects without one are normal here, and a host default
setup script covers them, so the prompt kept popping up for nothing. The
callout source and its policy are removed; the sidebar.worktreeSetup
strings stay in the locale files, which upstream owns.

Fork-Change: F-5
